   433	  driver never selects one, and the "representable but unserved target" hazard
   434	  that Rust and Swift both had to gate against therefore does not arise here;
   435	- the exact spelling of `-produce`/`-target`/`-o` and the produced filename are
   436	  obligations K-4 and K-6.
   437	
