   439	`manager-worker-v2` portable control set, the environment MUST:
   440	
   441	| Variable | Action | Why |
   442	|---|---|---|
   443	| `JDK_JAVA_OPTIONS` | unset | **MEASURED**: honoured by the JVM launcher; injects arbitrary JVM options |
   444	| `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS` | unset | **MEASURED**: honoured; same |
